    "body": "I *think* this is the same issue as #1441, which in turn will be fixed by #1341. \r\n\r\nI'm going to close as a duplicate for now--feel free to let me know if you think they're unrelated.\r\n\r\nAs a workaround, should be able to install starship with the following two commands:\r\n```\r\ncurl -fsSL https://starship.rs/install.sh -o install.sh\r\n./install.sh --platform pc-windows-msvc\r\n```",
